(
    id: "anneal-coarsening",
    name: "Anneal (twisted majority)",
    description: "Anneal (B4678/S35678), Vichniac's twisted majority vote: a 50 % random soup separates into live and dead domains whose boundaries straighten over time, like a cooling metal. The rule is symmetric under swapping live and dead cells.",
